WEBVTT

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:36.900 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:39.940 line:0%
[Episode 31]

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.160 line:0%
Unlimited funding does not mean

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.440 line:0%
the corrupt officials below

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:44.970 line:0%
can line their own pockets.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:48.339 line:0%
How many officials are involved?

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.770 line:0%
I'm afraid it's enough to shake the entire court.

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:56.279 line:0%
They have thoroughly enraged

00:01:56.279 --> 00:01:57.809 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.960 line:0%
This matter has far-reaching implications,

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.560 line:0%
and there's no movement yet.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.000 line:0%
I'm afraid that the Grand Empress Dowager

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.460 line:0%
plans to investigate thoroughly in secret,

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:10.380 line:0%
eradicate the corruption,

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.470 line:0%
and root it out completely.

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:18.200 line:0%
So what should we

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:19.640 line:0%
do now?

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:27.879 line:0%
I, your husband,

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:29.280 line:0%
disregarding the royal family's dignity,

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:30.879 line:0%
have rejected the imperial marriage decree.

00:02:30.879 --> 00:02:31.600 line:0%
I'm afraid

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:33.860 line:0%
I'll be left out in the cold in the future.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:36.920 line:0%
Honey, you wouldn't

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.650 line:0%
despise me for this, would you?

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:41.160 line:0%
Your schemes

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:42.520 line:0%
are probably too much

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.250 line:0%
for this courtyard to contain.

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:46.420 line:0%
But my feelings for you are something

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.010 line:0%
that heaven and earth can bear witness to.

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:58.879 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager issued a verbal decree,

00:02:58.879 --> 00:03:00.440 line:0%
ordering the Imperial Security Bureau

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.760 line:0%
to investigate Princess Runing

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:02.690 line:0%
and Prince Xian,

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:06.080 line:0%
while also keeping an eye on the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:07.680 line:0%
Could it be that the Grand Empress Dowager

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:08.960 line:0%
suspects Prince Xian?

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:13.440 line:0%
I'm afraid it's more than just that.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:51.020 line:0%
Here's the Grand Empress Dowager's verbal decree.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.640 line:0%
She commanded the Imperial Investigation Department

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:56.760 line:0%
to secretly investigate the Zhou family's relatives

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:59.240 line:0%
and keep close watch on Princess Ying's every move,

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:00.440 line:0%
reporting everything truthfully

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.100 line:0%
with no concealment allowed.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.020 line:0%
Additionally,

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.400 line:0%
they are to covertly monitor the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:06.600 line:0%
Any unusual activity

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.530 line:0%
must be reported immediately.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.520 line:0%
Yes.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.580 line:0%
I will carry out the order.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.360 line:0%
Madam Xu,

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:21.750 line:0%
I had people prepare

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.440 line:0%
fine tea from Junshan Island,

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:25.880 line:0%
brewed with snowmelt from Mount Tianshan.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.600 line:0%
Why don't you stay and have a taste?

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:31.360 line:0%
This tea is too cold in nature.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:33.120 line:0%
I'm afraid I can't enjoy such a luxury.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.720 line:0%
Lord Lai, there's no need to see me off.

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.640 line:0%
As for the Grand Empress Dowager's decree,

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:38.920 line:0%
I hope you act with utmost caution

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:40.810 line:0%
and handle it impartially,

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:41.920 line:0%
without delay.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:46.360 line:0%
Yes.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:48.959 line:0%
Thank you for the reminder.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:09.920 line:0%
Exquisite.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.280 line:0%
Shen Du is quite bold.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:30.480 line:0%
He actually rejected

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.140 line:0%
Mother's bestowed marriage.

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:34.800 line:0%
It seems I've underestimated Yan Xing.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.520 line:0%
How interesting.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.160 line:0%
Who would have thought that

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.880 line:0%
the cold-blooded and heartless Shen Du

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.540 line:0%
would truly fall for someone?

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.320 line:0%
In any case,

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:47.440 line:0%
this is

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:48.760 line:0%
good for us.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:49.680 line:0%
If Princess Ying gains the support

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:50.800 line:0%
of the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.000 line:0%
it will only make it more difficult

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.200 line:0%
for you to secure

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.440 line:0%
the position of Regent.

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:58.720 line:0%
Mentor, don't you find it surprising

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:01.000 line:0%
that Mother didn't impose any heavy punishments

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.130 line:0%
on Shen Du this time?

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:03.440 line:0%
With Mo Qianzhi's death,

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:04.680 line:0%
the position of the prefectural governor of Yingzhou

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:05.760 line:0%
is now vacant.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:06.800 line:0%
I heard that

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:08.080 line:0%
before returning to Xiang'an, Shen Du

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.640 line:0%
was attacked in an assassination attempt.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:10.680 line:0%
Afterward, he entered the palace

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:12.410 line:0%
and met with Mother overnight.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.600 line:0%
Not long after,

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.880 line:0%
the imperial marriage decree was issued.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.450 line:0%
What a coincidence.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.830 line:0%
I wonder what astonishing secret

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.730 line:0%
Shen Du uncovered in Yingzhou.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:28.050 line:0%
There might now be a rift

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:30.560 line:0%
between Shen Du and the Grand Empress Dowager

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.320 line:0%
due to the marriage decree.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.600 line:0%
He's rarely been summoned lately.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:35.440 line:0%
I heard that

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:36.520 line:0%
a group of maids in the palace

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.120 line:0%
has reached the age to return to their hometowns.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.000 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.040 line:0%
summoned Lai Luozhi

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.160 line:0%
and rewarded him with several maids.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.440 line:0%
Anyone with a brain can see

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:45.840 line:0%
that Lai Luozhi is now

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.240 line:0%
favored more by the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:50.320 line:0%
It seems only a matter of time before the Imperial Investigation Department

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.320 line:0%
overtakes the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:54.520 line:0%
It's too early to draw conclusions now.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:58.480 line:0%
Zhang Baohuan suddenly fell seriously ill,

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.730 line:0%
which is quite suspicious.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:01.880 line:0%
Mentor,

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:04.320 line:0%
I have a feeling that something big

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:06.050 line:0%
is going to happen in the court.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.760 line:0%
Human nature is hard to predict.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:12.480 line:0%
I will send more people

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.480 line:0%
to keep a close eye on Princess Ying.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:05.680 line:0%
Mr. Lan,

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:06.600 line:0%
he's one of us.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:08.480 line:0%
Men of Cang State cannot be trusted.

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.280 line:0%
He's also trying to catch that person from back then.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.160 line:0%
That person didn't just deceive

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:12.220 line:0%
Holy Maiden Daisi.

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:13.230 line:0%
You trust him?

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.160 line:0%
I do.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.040 line:0%
Come.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.040 line:0%
Thank you.

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:47.320 line:0%
Thank you.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:51.440 line:0%
Mr. Lan,

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:52.600 line:0%
you served

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.460 line:0%
Holy Maiden Daisi for many years.

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:55.960 line:0%
We want to know

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.360 line:0%
about what happened back then;

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:59.090 line:0%
the more detailed, the better.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.010 line:0%
It's been over 10 years.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:02.760 line:0%
At that time, Daisi was still

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:04.680 line:0%
the Holy Maiden of Jinwu Tribe.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:07.760 line:0%
After Jinwu Tribe sent emissaries

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.370 line:0%
to pay homage to Cang State,

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.480 line:0%
Cang State also sent emissaries

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:13.320 line:0%
to Jinwu to return the courtesy.

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.520 line:0%
Since then, the Jinwu Tribe and Cang State

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:17.120 line:0%
have been exchanging goods,

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.320 line:0%
and the people of both countries could freely enter and exit each other's territory,

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:20.840 line:0%
having frequent interactions.

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:22.280 line:0%
Once, on the street,

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.440 line:0%
the Holy Maiden was giving blessings

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:25.480 line:0%
to the common people.

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.200 line:0%
Don't rush. There's enough for everyone.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:29.530 line:0%
That's when she encountered that person.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.600 line:0%
It was just a chance encounter.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:37.120 line:0%
The Holy Maiden didn't pay much attention.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.640 line:0%
Not long after she returned,

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.360 line:0%
she forgot about him.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.480 line:0%
Because, as the Holy Maiden,

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.220 line:0%
she was forbidden to get married.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:46.780 line:0%
She should renounce love,

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:49.320 line:0%
living only for the people of the Jinwu Tribe.

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:50.120 line:0%
But unexpectedly,

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:51.240 line:0%
not long after,

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.760 line:0%
they met again.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.200 line:0%
But this time,

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.160 line:0%
it was at a royal banquet

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.000 line:0%
in Jinwu Tribe's palace.

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:02.280 line:0%
How could it be so coincidental?

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:02.960 line:0%
Holy Maiden

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:05.480 line:0%
-Holy Maiden.
-had never interacted with men outside.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:08.360 line:0%
Her heart was pure, and her upbringing was virtuous.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:10.000 line:0%
But once she fell in love,

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:12.200 line:0%
she was like a wild horse that had escaped its reins,

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:14.760 line:0%
and her feelings couldn't be hidden anymore.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.300 line:0%
After the welcoming banquet,

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.560 line:0%
while the envoys stayed,

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:20.880 line:0%
Daisi,

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.000 line:0%
as the Holy Maiden,

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:24.940 line:0%
[Daisi]

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.480 line:0%
frequently engaged with the envoys from Cang State.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:26.560 line:0%
And her purpose

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:27.880 line:0%
was to get closer

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.410 line:0%
to that man from Cang State.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:30.560 line:0%
What's this?

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:32.680 line:0%
Daisi.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.360 line:0%
Your name.

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.560 line:0%
To her surprise, this man from Cang State

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.440 line:0%
asked to learn

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:40.240 line:0%
Jinwu's language from the Holy Maiden.

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:39.710 line:0%
[Dai]

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.400 line:0%
This man from Cang State

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.200 line:0%
had an extraordinary talent for languages.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.760 line:0%
In just seven or eight days,

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.840 line:0%
he had learned most of it.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.200 line:0%
[Si]

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:50.080 line:0%
From that day on,

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:52.120 line:0%
the Holy Maiden learned

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:53.840 line:0%
his name.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:55.760 line:0%
Those three words

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:57.960 line:0%
should have been

00:10:58.160 --> 00:10:59.840 line:0%
deeply etched in her memory.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.520 line:0%
But later, no matter how hard she tried to remember,

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:02.840 line:0%
it was all a blur.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.400 line:0%
Their feelings for each other developed rapidly.

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:08.240 line:0%
In just a few days,

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.600 line:0%
they became inseparable.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:13.680 line:0%
However, the Holy Maiden had her duties.

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.240 line:0%
In front of others,

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.240 line:0%
she had to restrain herself.

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:20.080 line:0%
But at that time,

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:23.760 line:0%
the Holy Maiden's heart and eyes

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:26.200 line:0%
were full of that man from Cang State.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.320 line:0%
She cast

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:29.180 line:0%
all her responsibilities aside.

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.570 line:0%
But good times don't last long.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.040 line:0%
Soon after,

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:37.200 line:0%
something happened.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:38.720 line:0%
Would you be willing

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:40.580 line:0%
to come back to Cang State with me?

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:44.440 line:0%
I know your identity is special.

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:46.330 line:0%
Meeting you

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.840 line:0%
has already used up my lifetime of luck.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.380 line:0%
How could I ask for anything more?

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:52.400 line:0%
No.

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:53.960 line:0%
I'm willing.

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:55.800 line:0%
Of course I am.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:00.240 line:0%
After that,

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.240 line:0%
we couldn't find

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.640 line:0%
the Holy Maiden anymore.

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:06.240 line:0%
Some people claimed

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:07.880 line:0%
to have seen her wearing

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.100 line:0%
the attire of a Cang State woman,

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.720 line:0%
riding with a man from Cang State

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:13.920 line:0%
toward his homeland.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:17.340 line:0%
Jinwu didn't want the scandal to spread,

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:19.780 line:0%
so they publicly declared

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.680 line:0%
that the Holy Maiden had passed away from illness

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:23.400 line:0%
and erased her identity.

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:26.360 line:0%
From then on,

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.600 line:0%
Jinwu ceased all connections with Cang State.

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:31.520 line:0%
I had originally thought

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.560 line:0%
this man from Cang State

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.040 line:0%
would stay loyal to the Holy Maiden,

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.500 line:0%
and that they would live happily ever after.

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:38.120 line:0%
But unexpectedly,

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:39.960 line:0%
not long after,

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:42.540 line:0%
right in this dilapidated house,

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:43.840 line:0%
I found the Holy Maiden

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.940 line:0%
on the brink of death.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.000 line:0%
Holy Maiden! Holy Maiden!

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:51.640 line:0%
Holy Maiden,

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:53.020 line:0%
how could this happen?

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.880 line:0%
I am no longer the Holy Maiden.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:57.360 line:0%
Holy Maiden,

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:58.560 line:0%
come back with me.

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.240 line:0%
Everything will be alright.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:02.930 line:0%
I can't go back anymore.

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:04.480 line:0%
Where is that man?

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.040 line:0%
Where is he?

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:08.440 line:0%
He deceived me.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:11.360 line:0%
He tricked me into revealing

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:13.760 line:0%
the secrets that Holy Maidens should keep.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:15.480 line:0%
He tricked me into teaching him the secret technique

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.740 line:0%
to control moths with medicinal powder.

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:19.080 line:0%
I was so foolish.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.740 line:0%
How could I have believed him?

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.520 line:0%
When I discovered

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:24.280 line:0%
that he had evil intentions,

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:26.360 line:0%
was practicing evil skills,

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.200 line:0%
and even tried to use those techniques

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.730 line:0%
to manipulate others into doing his bidding,

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.440 line:0%
he decided to kill me.

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:37.570 line:0%
Holy Maiden? Holy Maiden!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:40.800 line:0%
Holy Maiden.

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:42.840 line:0%
It's too late.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.640 line:0%
Everything is too late.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.360 line:0%
My sins are unforgivable.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:52.920 line:0%
-I deserve to die.
-No. No.

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:55.760 line:0%
Holy Maiden!

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:00.960 line:0%
This person

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.240 line:0%
truly deserves to be cut into a thousand pieces.

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:04.370 line:0%
Death isn't enough!

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:05.880 line:0%
Calm down.

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:12.360 line:0%
We will uncover his crimes

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:13.240 line:0%
sooner or later

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.560 line:0%
and expose them to the world.

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:23.000 line:0%
Mr. Lan,

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:24.400 line:0%
take a look at these portraits

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.330 line:0%
and see if any of them resemble him.

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:30.940 line:0%
[Qianniu Guard]

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:36.950 line:0%
[Qianniu Guard]

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:40.560 line:0%
This mole... This mole!

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.940 line:0%
[Imperial Investigation Department]

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:41.710 line:0%
It's him!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:48.720 line:0%
[Imperial Investigation Department]

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:51.080 line:0%
He's the man from Cang State!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.320 line:0%
It's him! it's him!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:53.360 line:0%
You've found him?

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:54.040 line:0%
Where is he?

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:54.600 line:0%
Where is he?

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:56.000 line:0%
-I'll kill him!
-Mr. Lan!

00:14:56.190 --> 00:14:57.930 line:0%
Leave it to us.

00:14:58.240 --> 00:14:59.040 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:00.960 line:0%
I will make sure this man

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.700 line:0%
pays the price he deserves

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:06.000 line:0%
and give Holy Maiden Daisi the justice she is owed.

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.000 line:0%
May the Holy Maiden's spirit watch over us from heaven.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.840 line:0%
That person has committed so many evil deeds.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.900 line:0%
He will inevitably face retribution

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:21.310 line:0%
and die without a proper burial.

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:31.380 line:0%
Holy Maiden Daisi

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:33.320 line:0%
once caught that betrayer

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:35.160 line:0%
teaching others how to use accelerant technique

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:36.640 line:0%
to burn down a granary.

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.320 line:0%
She rebuked him

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:40.760 line:0%
for disregarding the people of Cang State,

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:43.140 line:0%
but he sneered and said

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:45.240 line:0%
it wasn't him who was

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:46.320 line:0%
disregarding themâ€”

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:47.120 line:0%
it was...

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:52.360 line:0%
it was...

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:54.420 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:56.360 line:0%
of Cang State.

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:58.720 line:0%
And the ones who ordered him to burn the granary

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:01.800 line:0%
were none other than the Zhou family, who are closely related

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:03.460 line:0%
to the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:06.440 line:0%
When Holy Maiden Daisi ran away,

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:07.760 line:0%
she stole the token

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:09.200 line:0%
the betrayer had used

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:10.730 line:0%
to deal with the arsonists.

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:12.440 line:0%
It's this very jade pendant.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:29.760 line:0%
Yan Xing,

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:32.240 line:0%
I hope it's not too late.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:37.710 line:0%
[Cangming Hall]

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:36.570 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.240 line:0%
I have a matter to report.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:41.320 line:0%
What is it, Mr. Lai?

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.410 line:0%
I want to impeach

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:45.360 line:0%
Sun Tan, the Constable Marshal in Gannan Area,

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:46.880 line:0%
for dereliction of duty.

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:48.200 line:0%
In the Half-faced Ghosts case,

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:48.880 line:0%
Sun Tan led

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.200 line:0%
the constables in Gannan Area to fully cooperate

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:51.600 line:0%
with the investigation.

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:53.340 line:0%
I saw that with my own eyes.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:55.200 line:0%
How is it that, in your words,

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.400 line:0%
his efforts have turned into crimes instead of merits?

00:16:57.400 --> 00:16:58.400 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:01.000 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department has gathered

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.360 line:0%
numerous pieces of evidence

00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:04.680 line:0%
proving Sun Tan's corruption, misconduct, and abuse of power for personal gain.

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:06.720 line:0%
I now present them to you.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.930 line:0%
Please review them, Your Majesty.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.360 line:0%
The laws of Cang State state:

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.480 line:0%
"To take something that does not belong to you is called theft."

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:23.909 line:0%
A supervisor who steals from those under his charge,

00:17:23.909 --> 00:17:25.720 line:0%
accepts bribes, abuses power for personal gain,

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:27.240 line:0%
and acts unjustly

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.520 line:0%
shall be sentenced to death by strangulation.

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:31.280 line:0%
Sun Tan used his position to amass wealth,

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.400 line:0%
accept bribes, and secretly collaborate with bandits.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.060 line:0%
The evidence is irrefutable.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.120 line:0%
Your Majesty, please grant me permission

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.280 line:0%
to administer punishment in accordance with the law.

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.280 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:41.280 line:0%
under the torture of the Imperial Investigation Department,

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:43.320 line:0%
he might have made forced confessions.

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:44.480 line:0%
Please consider carefully

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:45.960 line:0%
whether Sun Tan's dereliction of duty

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.160 line:0%
deserves the death penalty by strangulation.

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.320 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:49.080 line:0%
your Imperial Security Bureau

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:50.200 line:0%
is also famous for its reputation

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:51.520 line:0%
as a place of hell,

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:52.480 line:0%
as harsh in its punishments

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.440 line:0%
as the Imperial Imperial Investigation Department.

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:55.480 line:0%
Yet here you are, in the court,

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:56.960 line:0%
showing unnecessary compassion

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:58.880 line:0%
and insisting on protecting the criminal official Sun Tan.

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.210 line:0%
What is your intention?

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:02.360 line:0%
Alright.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:07.160 line:0%
I'm feeling a bit tired today.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:08.960 line:0%
Leave the evidence here,

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.450 line:0%
and we will discuss it another day.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:16.420 line:0%
-I'll take my leave.
-I'll take my leave.

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:38.280 line:0%
Leave us.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:41.920 line:0%
Prince Xian...

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:43.720 line:0%
When pruning the branches,

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:44.600 line:0%
one must be extremely careful

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:45.930 line:0%
and pay full attention.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:56.330 line:0%
How does it look now?

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:58.840 line:0%
Is it much better than before?

00:19:05.360 --> 00:19:07.120 line:0%
Prince Xian, you...

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:10.800 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:12.560 line:0%
Lai Luozhi has been

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:13.520 line:0%
wielding his power in the court,

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:14.960 line:0%
arresting officials at will

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.080 line:0%
with baseless charges.

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:16.840 line:0%
Now, he has extended his reach

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.280 line:0%
to Gannan Area.

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:20.640 line:0%
Such behavior...

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:21.960 line:0%
When you become the Regent,

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:24.090 line:0%
he will be a significant threat to you.

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:25.340 line:0%
How about this?

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.000 line:0%
I'll have someone file a complaint about him

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.660 line:0%
at tomorrow's court session.

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:33.100 line:0%
Minister Zhang,

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:36.360 line:0%
withered leaves will eventually fall.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.290 line:0%
Even if we can stop the autumn wind,

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:41.370 line:0%
can we stop the winter snow?

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:46.480 line:0%
Your Highness, What do you mean by that?

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:50.120 line:0%
Nothing.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.590 line:0%
Have these people from Xichen and Nanlang

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.240 line:0%
recently appeared in the city?

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:04.880 line:0%
Yes.

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:06.560 line:0%
Recently, Cang State has been welcoming envoys from all over,

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:08.120 line:0%
gathering talented individuals from across the world.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.960 line:0%
These people from Xichen and Nanlang

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:11.040 line:0%
have all recently come to Xiang'an City

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.000 line:0%
to make a living.

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:13.400 line:0%
We need to be

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:14.680 line:0%
more cautious

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:16.860 line:0%
when patrolling the city.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.200 line:0%
Yes.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:23.500 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:24.600 line:0%
it's Shen Du.

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:35.060 line:0%
I just can't swallow my anger.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:36.440 line:0%
This White Ghost actually dared

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:38.160 line:0%
to openly oppose the bestowed marriage,

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:40.010 line:0%
embarrassing Princess Jia'an.

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:41.490 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:43.500 line:0%
you shouldn't let him off easily.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:44.920 line:0%
This Shen Du,

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:47.120 line:0%
just like his father,

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:49.720 line:0%
is always an ungrateful person.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.790 line:0%
Mother had good intentions,

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.000 line:0%
but he doesn't understand the benefits

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.280 line:0%
of having powerful backing.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.880 line:0%
You've watched Jia'an grow up since she was a child,

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:01.120 line:0%
and you've spent more time with her

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:02.800 line:0%
than I, her mother, have.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:05.400 line:0%
Naturally, you care for her deeply.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:12.080 line:0%
But since ancient times,

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.610 line:0%
the dignity of the royal family is paramount.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.700 line:0%
Now that Mother has lost face,

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:19.120 line:0%
even without our interference,

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:20.680 line:0%
Shen Du's future path

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:22.760 line:0%
will be difficult.

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.040 line:0%
Xing,

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:35.040 line:0%
you're so kind.

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:37.000 line:0%
You're already the Director,

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.240 line:0%
and you're still helping me organize the files.

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:40.360 line:0%
When I was

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:42.160 line:0%
just a little scribe,

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:43.600 line:0%
I never saw you, Secretary Lu,

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:44.860 line:0%
treat me with disdain.

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:46.820 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.120 line:0%
Try this.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:50.120 line:0%
It's from Gannan Area.

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:58.080 line:0%
Indeed, it's sweeter than what we have in Xiang'an City.

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:58.840 line:0%
Have one.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.280 line:0%
The honey from Gannan Area

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:02.480 line:0%
is especially sweet.

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:05.170 line:0%
Not only can it be used to preserve fruits,

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:08.180 line:0%
but it can even be used to preserve human flash.

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:10.470 line:0%
Yan Xing!

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:11.770 line:0%
I hate you!

00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:13.450 line:0%
Lu Chuichui.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:15.180 line:0%
Lu Chuichui, Lu Chuichui.

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:17.120 line:0%
How dare you let Director Yan

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:18.480 line:0%
help you organize the files?

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:19.740 line:0%
What are you thinking?

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:24.760 line:0%
You used to

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:27.600 line:0%
always order Director Yan around.

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:29.390 line:0%
I...

00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:31.040 line:0%
That was in the past, wasn't it?

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:32.240 line:0%
Right, Director Yan?

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:37.440 line:0%
Director Yan.

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:43.700 line:0%
Times have changed.

00:22:44.560 --> 00:22:45.600 line:0%
Now you and I are colleagues

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:47.760 line:0%
of the same rank and level.

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:50.120 line:0%
And you're now the wife of the Grand Commander.

00:22:50.120 --> 00:22:52.000 line:0%
From now on,

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:55.320 line:0%
I'll have to rely on your care.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:58.900 line:0%
Director Wu, what are you talking about?

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:01.560 line:0%
Although I hold the nominal title of the Director

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:03.520 line:0%
because of the Grand Empress Dowager's favor,

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:06.160 line:0%
I'm still under the jurisdiction of the Ministry of Justice.

00:23:06.160 --> 00:23:07.280 line:0%
I am still under your command

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:09.560 line:0%
when investigating cases and handling official duties.

00:23:09.560 --> 00:23:10.480 line:0%
In the future,

00:23:10.600 --> 00:23:12.520 line:0%
I'll have to count on you more.

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:15.600 line:0%
Of course, of course.

00:23:16.800 --> 00:23:18.040 line:0%
Your official tone

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.840 line:0%
is making me want to vomit.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:25.800 line:0%
Feng Gui.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:35.960 line:0%
Please, have a seat.

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:43.840 line:0%
Since you still

00:23:43.840 --> 00:23:45.900 line:0%
acknowledge me as your old director,

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:47.640 line:0%
I'll say something to you

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:49.560 line:0%
in private today.

00:23:57.120 --> 00:23:58.040 line:0%
Now,

00:23:58.080 --> 00:24:00.160 line:0%
you are the wife of the Grand Commander

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:01.490 line:0%
and have been promoted.

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:02.920 line:0%
Among the female officials in the Six Ministries,

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:04.450 line:0%
you are truly standing out.

00:24:05.080 --> 00:24:06.160 line:0%
But as the old saying goes,

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:09.020 line:0%
"Power that burns too brightly burns out quickly."

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:10.000 line:0%
Do you know that

00:24:10.360 --> 00:24:11.520 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager now

00:24:11.520 --> 00:24:13.320 line:0%
favors the Black Rakshasa

00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:15.120 line:0%
and disregards the White Ghost?

00:24:22.360 --> 00:24:24.040 line:0%
You...

00:24:26.320 --> 00:24:28.520 line:0%
The wives of high-ranking officials are all sophisticated

00:24:28.520 --> 00:24:32.400 line:0%
and skilled in navigating social circles,

00:24:32.400 --> 00:24:33.360 line:0%
so they can

00:24:33.360 --> 00:24:36.000 line:0%
gather valuable secrets for their husbands.

00:24:36.600 --> 00:24:37.880 line:0%
There's no one like you,

00:24:37.880 --> 00:24:38.920 line:0%
spending all your time

00:24:38.920 --> 00:24:41.040 line:0%
with files and in morgues,

00:24:41.080 --> 00:24:42.440 line:0%
like a fool.

00:24:44.470 --> 00:24:45.410 line:0%
[Wise and Insightful]

00:24:56.400 --> 00:24:57.440 line:0%
What I mean is,

00:24:57.760 --> 00:24:59.820 line:0%
now that Lord Lai has grown powerful,

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:00.840 line:0%
he's been arresting officials

00:25:00.840 --> 00:25:02.040 line:0%
at the court every now and then.

00:25:02.040 --> 00:25:03.320 line:0%
And the Grand Empress Dowager's

00:25:03.320 --> 00:25:06.280 line:0%
indulgence and favoritism toward Lord Lai

00:25:06.600 --> 00:25:08.840 line:0%
even surpass those of her favorite official, Zhang Baohuan.

00:25:08.840 --> 00:25:11.120 line:0%
Every time Lord Lai petitions to arrest someone,

00:25:11.120 --> 00:25:12.800 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager always agrees.

00:25:12.800 --> 00:25:13.520 line:0%
The officials in the court

00:25:13.520 --> 00:25:16.080 line:0%
are all living in fear.

00:25:18.200 --> 00:25:20.330 line:0%
Is Lai Luozhi really that tyrannical?

00:25:29.680 --> 00:25:30.480 line:0%
So,

00:25:30.680 --> 00:25:31.560 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:25:31.920 --> 00:25:32.780 line:0%
think about it.

00:25:33.160 --> 00:25:34.480 line:0%
How could the Black Rakshasa

00:25:34.480 --> 00:25:36.520 line:0%
tolerate the existence

00:25:36.520 --> 00:25:38.120 line:0%
of the White Ghost,

00:25:38.120 --> 00:25:39.920 line:0%
who is his equal?

00:25:40.320 --> 00:25:41.280 line:0%
Put yourself in his shoes.

00:25:41.280 --> 00:25:42.960 line:0%
Even if it were me,

00:25:43.280 --> 00:25:44.720 line:0%
I would definitely want there to be

00:25:44.720 --> 00:25:47.150 line:0%
only one Lord of Hell

00:25:47.450 --> 00:25:49.220 line:0%
in this world.

00:25:55.190 --> 00:25:56.960 line:0%
Thank you for the reminder, Director Wu.

00:25:56.960 --> 00:25:58.200 line:0%
Indeed,

00:25:59.040 --> 00:26:00.760 line:0%
the more I understand my husband,

00:26:00.760 --> 00:26:02.080 line:0%
the more I feel that,

00:26:02.240 --> 00:26:03.560 line:0%
despite his high position,

00:26:03.560 --> 00:26:04.800 line:0%
he walks on thin ice.

00:26:06.880 --> 00:26:08.480 line:0%
I don't understand politics,

00:26:08.480 --> 00:26:10.320 line:0%
and I don't know how to help him.

00:26:10.920 --> 00:26:12.600 line:0%
All I can do is take care of what's within my responsibilities,

00:26:12.600 --> 00:26:13.360 line:0%
hoping

00:26:13.360 --> 00:26:14.800 line:0%
I don't cause him trouble.

00:26:14.800 --> 00:26:15.840 line:0%
You?

00:26:18.000 --> 00:26:19.200 line:0%
Don't cause trouble?

00:26:25.360 --> 00:26:27.360 line:0%
Lai Luozhi is treating human life as if it has no value,

00:26:27.360 --> 00:26:28.760 line:0%
and is no one going to do anything about it?

00:26:28.760 --> 00:26:29.320 line:0%
What's going on?

00:26:29.320 --> 00:26:30.200 line:0%
-What happened?
-Commander Xu?

00:26:30.200 --> 00:26:31.680 line:0%
If the Ministry of Justice is not going to do anything,

00:26:31.680 --> 00:26:32.920 line:0%
I'll go to the imperial palace

00:26:32.920 --> 00:26:34.420 line:0%
and ask the Grand Empress Dowager

00:26:34.420 --> 00:26:36.910 line:0%
[Wise and Insightful]

00:26:34.880 --> 00:26:36.280 line:0%
if there's still any justice

00:26:36.280 --> 00:26:37.540 line:0%
in today's Cang State.

00:26:40.480 --> 00:26:42.720 line:0%
Shut your mouth!

00:26:42.960 --> 00:26:43.920 line:0%
Get lost, get lost.

00:26:43.920 --> 00:26:45.600 line:0%
If you want to die, I'm not going to stop you.

00:26:45.600 --> 00:26:47.280 line:0%
I have so many people in the Ministry of Justice.

00:26:47.280 --> 00:26:48.160 line:0%
I don't want the Black Rakshasa

00:26:48.160 --> 00:26:50.320 line:0%
cutting off my ears in the middle of the night.

00:26:50.320 --> 00:26:51.140 line:0%
Xu,

00:26:51.360 --> 00:26:52.800 line:0%
what exactly happened?

00:26:53.600 --> 00:26:55.460 line:0%
Lai Luozhi arrested Sun Tan.

00:26:55.880 --> 00:26:56.680 line:0%
Sun Tan?

00:26:57.760 --> 00:27:00.220 line:0%
Constable Marshal Sun Tan from Gannan Area?

00:27:00.360 --> 00:27:01.760 line:0%
Wasn't his file just sent

00:27:01.760 --> 00:27:02.720 line:0%
to the Supreme Court today

00:27:02.720 --> 00:27:04.160 line:0%
after the court session?

00:27:04.200 --> 00:27:06.000 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager hasn't made a decision yet.

00:27:06.000 --> 00:27:07.720 line:0%
Why has the Imperial Investigation Department already arrested him?

00:27:07.720 --> 00:27:09.600 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager hasn't made a verdict,

00:27:09.600 --> 00:27:11.800 line:0%
but the Imperial Investigation Department has already detained him.

00:27:11.800 --> 00:27:13.360 line:0%
But for every day one stays in

00:27:13.360 --> 00:27:14.000 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department's prisons,

00:27:14.000 --> 00:27:15.600 line:0%
they'll lose 10 years of their life.

00:27:15.600 --> 00:27:16.920 line:0%
If this drags on,

00:27:16.960 --> 00:27:17.720 line:0%
before the Grand Empress Dowager

00:27:17.720 --> 00:27:18.880 line:0%
makes a verdict,

00:27:18.880 --> 00:27:20.520 line:0%
Sun Tan might already be dead.

00:27:20.520 --> 00:27:22.680 line:0%
This Lord Lai has been acting tyrannical

00:27:22.680 --> 00:27:24.360 line:0%
for more than a day or two.

00:27:24.520 --> 00:27:25.240 line:0%
When it comes down to it,

00:27:25.240 --> 00:27:26.600 line:0%
this matter should be under the jurisdiction of the Supreme Court.

00:27:26.600 --> 00:27:28.080 line:0%
You came to the Ministry of Justice to cry for injustice.

00:27:28.080 --> 00:27:29.360 line:0%
Did you knock on the wrong door?

00:27:29.360 --> 00:27:30.320 line:0%
Is this your first day knowing

00:27:30.320 --> 00:27:32.160 line:0%
about the Minister of the Supreme Court?

00:27:32.160 --> 00:27:34.600 line:0%
Those people are always timid and avoid trouble.

00:27:34.600 --> 00:27:35.720 line:0%
Sun Tan's case

00:27:35.720 --> 00:27:37.280 line:0%
was initiated by the Imperial Investigation Department

00:27:37.280 --> 00:27:38.880 line:0%
and involves the constables.

00:27:38.880 --> 00:27:39.680 line:0%
Now,

00:27:39.840 --> 00:27:40.760 line:0%
they have already transferred it

00:27:40.760 --> 00:27:41.760 line:0%
to your Ministry of Justice.

00:27:41.760 --> 00:27:43.360 line:0%
The Supreme Court? I...

00:27:45.680 --> 00:27:46.920 line:0%
My headache!

00:27:46.920 --> 00:27:47.600 line:0%
Feng Gui!

00:27:47.600 --> 00:27:48.760 line:0%
I'm here, I'm here.

00:27:48.760 --> 00:27:49.640 line:0%
What happened?

00:27:53.240 --> 00:27:54.920 line:0%
Director Wu, take your time to recover.

00:27:54.920 --> 00:27:55.760 line:0%
If the Ministry of Justice

00:27:55.760 --> 00:27:57.080 line:0%
can't give justice to my brother,

00:27:57.080 --> 00:27:57.800 line:0%
I don't mind

00:27:57.800 --> 00:27:59.320 line:0%
barging into the imperial palace again.

00:27:59.320 --> 00:28:00.320 line:0%
Be careful.

00:28:00.560 --> 00:28:01.240 line:0%
Let's go, let's go.

00:28:01.240 --> 00:28:02.800 line:0%
Director Wu is even more timid

00:28:02.800 --> 00:28:04.080 line:0%
than the Minister

00:28:04.080 --> 00:28:05.320 line:0%
of the Supreme Court.

00:28:05.760 --> 00:28:08.360 line:0%
I think you might have come to the wrong person.

00:28:11.120 --> 00:28:12.000 line:0%
Yun Que,

00:28:12.360 --> 00:28:14.020 line:0%
why are you with Commander Xu?

00:28:14.600 --> 00:28:15.800 line:0%
I'm also a constable.

00:28:15.800 --> 00:28:18.330 line:0%
What's wrong with me being with Commander Xu?

00:28:19.480 --> 00:28:20.880 line:0%
Go back to your business now.

00:28:20.880 --> 00:28:21.440 line:0%
Yes.

00:28:25.480 --> 00:28:26.540 line:0%
I'll take my leave.

00:28:27.000 --> 00:28:27.800 line:0%
Xu.

00:28:29.680 --> 00:28:30.520 line:0%
You've always been

00:28:30.520 --> 00:28:31.400 line:0%
straightforward

00:28:31.400 --> 00:28:32.360 line:0%
and outspoken.

00:28:32.800 --> 00:28:33.720 line:0%
Why are you

00:28:33.720 --> 00:28:35.320 line:0%
being so cautious today?

00:28:35.680 --> 00:28:37.120 line:0%
Have you forgotten that

00:28:37.680 --> 00:28:38.760 line:0%
I'm also

00:28:39.040 --> 00:28:40.080 line:0%
a director under the jurisdiction

00:28:40.080 --> 00:28:41.810 line:0%
of the Ministry of Justice now?

00:28:41.880 --> 00:28:42.920 line:0%
In terms of rank,

00:28:43.400 --> 00:28:45.360 line:0%
I'm on the same level as Director Wu.

00:28:45.360 --> 00:28:47.280 line:0%
I also have the authority to preside over cases.

00:28:47.280 --> 00:28:48.360 line:0%
I can apply

00:28:49.120 --> 00:28:50.280 line:0%
to be the chief judge for Sun Tan's case.

00:28:50.280 --> 00:28:51.560 line:0%
I've told you

00:28:51.760 --> 00:28:53.140 line:0%
that you could ask Xing for help.

00:28:53.140 --> 00:28:54.150 line:0%
Xing,

00:28:54.320 --> 00:28:55.320 line:0%
aren't you obviously

00:28:55.320 --> 00:28:56.850 line:0%
going to offend Lai Luozhi?

00:28:57.040 --> 00:28:57.920 line:0%
Didn't you say

00:28:57.920 --> 00:29:00.120 line:0%
you wouldn't cause trouble for Shen Du?

00:29:00.570 --> 00:29:01.630 line:0%
Yes.

00:29:03.040 --> 00:29:05.500 line:0%
I just said I wouldn't cause trouble for him.

00:29:07.960 --> 00:29:08.760 line:0%
Xing,

00:29:09.320 --> 00:29:10.040 line:0%
I know that,

00:29:10.040 --> 00:29:11.680 line:0%
now, with the political intrigue in the court

00:29:11.680 --> 00:29:13.240 line:0%
and the unpredictable will of the ruler,

00:29:13.240 --> 00:29:15.320 line:0%
Shen Du is not having an easy time either.

00:29:15.320 --> 00:29:16.240 line:0%
You should

00:29:16.440 --> 00:29:17.480 line:0%
stay out of this matter.

00:29:17.480 --> 00:29:18.840 line:0%
But this is about you.

00:29:19.440 --> 00:29:19.960 line:0%
Also,

00:29:19.960 --> 00:29:21.080 line:0%
Sun Tan was of great help to us

00:29:21.080 --> 00:29:22.400 line:0%
in Gannan Area.

00:29:22.400 --> 00:29:23.200 line:0%
I believe that

00:29:23.320 --> 00:29:24.560 line:0%
if it were him,

00:29:24.640 --> 00:29:26.000 line:0%
he would choose to help.

00:29:32.560 --> 00:29:33.360 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:29:34.320 --> 00:29:35.320 line:0%
thank you so much.

00:29:37.400 --> 00:29:38.960 line:0%
Since I've promised to help,

00:29:38.960 --> 00:29:41.240 line:0%
this matter needs to be carefully planned.

00:29:41.240 --> 00:29:42.160 line:0%
Come with me.

00:29:42.640 --> 00:29:43.170 line:0%
Let's go.

00:29:44.620 --> 00:29:47.550 line:0%
[Wise and Insightful]

00:29:57.400 --> 00:29:58.320 line:0%
My Lord,

00:29:58.400 --> 00:29:59.840 line:0%
Sun Tan is quite tough.

00:29:59.840 --> 00:30:00.720 line:0%
We've tried every method

00:30:00.720 --> 00:30:01.840 line:0%
that doesn't endanger his life,

00:30:01.840 --> 00:30:03.500 line:0%
but he still refuses to speak.

00:30:04.120 --> 00:30:05.440 line:0%
When did the people

00:30:06.600 --> 00:30:07.640 line:0%
from the Imperial Investigation Department

00:30:07.640 --> 00:30:09.160 line:0%
start showing mercy?

00:30:11.640 --> 00:30:13.920 line:0%
Whether he admits it or not doesn't matter.

00:30:13.920 --> 00:30:15.780 line:0%
As long as he's not in Gannan Area,

00:30:16.360 --> 00:30:18.040 line:0%
the constables in Gannan Area

00:30:18.400 --> 00:30:20.080 line:0%
won't pose a threat.

00:30:22.720 --> 00:30:24.360 line:0%
Those who try to block my way

00:30:25.400 --> 00:30:27.480 line:0%
won't have a good end.

00:30:28.800 --> 00:30:29.600 line:0%
Xu,

00:30:29.680 --> 00:30:31.600 line:0%
do you know if Lai Luozhi has

00:30:31.600 --> 00:30:32.160 line:0%
any real leverage

00:30:32.160 --> 00:30:34.160 line:0%
against Sun Tan?

00:30:34.160 --> 00:30:34.880 line:0%
Do you know

00:30:34.880 --> 00:30:36.650 line:0%
why the constables are called this name?

00:30:36.650 --> 00:30:38.480 line:0%
Our country recruits wandering knights

00:30:38.480 --> 00:30:39.920 line:0%
to serve as officers responsible for investigating cases and arresting criminals.

00:30:39.920 --> 00:30:40.880 line:0%
These people are called constables.

00:30:40.880 --> 00:30:41.680 line:0%
That's right.

00:30:41.880 --> 00:30:42.760 line:0%
The reason why the constables

00:30:42.760 --> 00:30:44.320 line:0%
can have eyes and ears everywhere,

00:30:44.320 --> 00:30:45.640 line:0%
obtaining information more easily

00:30:45.640 --> 00:30:47.560 line:0%
than other government offices in the court,

00:30:47.560 --> 00:30:48.520 line:0%
is that at the time

00:30:48.520 --> 00:30:49.600 line:0%
of its establishment,

00:30:49.600 --> 00:30:50.240 line:0%
it recruited

00:30:50.240 --> 00:30:52.120 line:0%
people from all walks of life across the world.

00:30:52.120 --> 00:30:53.920 line:0%
That's why we're called constables.

00:30:53.920 --> 00:30:55.880 line:0%
Many of the constables, before being recruited,

00:30:55.880 --> 00:30:57.800 line:0%
were either bandits who robbed and looted or,

00:30:57.800 --> 00:30:58.920 line:0%
like me,

00:30:58.920 --> 00:31:00.510 line:0%
skilled thieves.

00:31:00.720 --> 00:31:01.680 line:0%
After being recruited,

00:31:01.680 --> 00:31:02.680 line:0%
we couldn't possibly sever ties

00:31:02.680 --> 00:31:03.960 line:0%
with all our martial world friends.

00:31:03.960 --> 00:31:05.160 line:0%
To pin a crime on us,

00:31:05.200 --> 00:31:07.260 line:0%
Lai Luozhi can fabricate one at will.

00:31:07.480 --> 00:31:08.600 line:0%
About Sun Tan's case,

00:31:08.600 --> 00:31:09.560 line:0%
I'm worried

00:31:09.560 --> 00:31:10.760 line:0%
that it's not just about

00:31:10.760 --> 00:31:12.020 line:0%
capturing one person.

00:31:12.360 --> 00:31:13.120 line:0%
Although Lai Luozhi

00:31:13.120 --> 00:31:14.680 line:0%
has always been arrogant and domineering,

00:31:14.680 --> 00:31:15.520 line:0%
he has never dared

00:31:15.520 --> 00:31:17.050 line:0%
to provoke the constables.

00:31:17.440 --> 00:31:18.960 line:0%
But now, just after the Half-faced Ghosts case

00:31:18.960 --> 00:31:20.160 line:0%
was resolved

00:31:20.320 --> 00:31:22.480 line:0%
and Gannan Area is still in need of reconstruction,

00:31:22.480 --> 00:31:23.880 line:0%
he has arrested Sun Tan.

00:31:24.400 --> 00:31:26.280 line:0%
Is he targeting the constables

00:31:26.280 --> 00:31:27.280 line:0%
or Gannan Area?

00:31:27.440 --> 00:31:28.200 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:31:28.200 --> 00:31:29.440 line:0%
you've only just returned

00:31:29.440 --> 00:31:30.280 line:0%
and might not be aware

00:31:30.280 --> 00:31:30.960 line:0%
of what has happened

00:31:30.960 --> 00:31:32.160 line:0%
in Xiang'an City.

00:31:32.520 --> 00:31:33.440 line:0%
The Mingsheng Temple,

00:31:33.440 --> 00:31:35.200 line:0%
where Princess Runing lives in seclusion,

00:31:35.200 --> 00:31:36.520 line:0%
has been frequently visited

00:31:36.520 --> 00:31:38.440 line:0%
by Prince Ying's carriages these days.

00:31:38.440 --> 00:31:41.400 line:0%
Princess Runing and Princess Yong'an?

00:31:41.680 --> 00:31:43.480 line:0%
The current emperor is young and slow in learning to speak.

00:31:43.480 --> 00:31:44.200 line:0%
How much longer can the Grand Empress Dowager

00:31:44.200 --> 00:31:45.840 line:0%
rule Cang State?

00:31:46.040 --> 00:31:47.440 line:0%
Many people now believe that

00:31:47.440 --> 00:31:49.120 line:0%
Princess Ying has more potential than Prince Xian

00:31:49.120 --> 00:31:50.680 line:0%
to become the Regent.

00:31:52.320 --> 00:31:53.720 line:0%
Princess Runing

00:31:53.720 --> 00:31:55.650 line:0%
has decided to help Princess Ying?

00:31:55.760 --> 00:31:56.840 line:0%
Princess Runing

00:31:56.840 --> 00:31:57.640 line:0%
is the highest-ranking princess

00:31:57.640 --> 00:31:59.040 line:0%
of the Xiao royal family.

00:31:59.040 --> 00:32:00.240 line:0%
If she takes a stance,

00:32:00.240 --> 00:32:01.040 line:0%
it will surely change

00:32:01.040 --> 00:32:02.640 line:0%
the political situation in the court.

00:32:02.640 --> 00:32:03.440 line:0%
Besides,

00:32:03.560 --> 00:32:04.600 line:0%
the reconstruction of Ming Hall,

00:32:04.600 --> 00:32:05.960 line:0%
which was supposed to be nearing completion,

00:32:05.960 --> 00:32:07.490 line:0%
has strangely slowed down,

00:32:07.800 --> 00:32:09.000 line:0%
and you could even say

00:32:09.000 --> 00:32:10.160 line:0%
it has nearly come to a halt.

00:32:10.160 --> 00:32:10.720 line:0%
This happened

00:32:10.720 --> 00:32:11.680 line:0%
shortly after we returned

00:32:11.680 --> 00:32:12.680 line:0%
from Gannan Area.

00:32:12.720 --> 00:32:13.580 line:0%
Additionally,

00:32:13.800 --> 00:32:14.840 line:0%
recently, many foreigners

00:32:14.840 --> 00:32:15.360 line:0%
from Nanlang and Xichen

00:32:15.360 --> 00:32:17.160 line:0%
have appeared in Xiang'an City.

00:32:17.360 --> 00:32:18.440 line:0%
These things, when viewed separately,

00:32:18.440 --> 00:32:19.760 line:0%
might seem insignificant,

00:32:19.760 --> 00:32:21.040 line:0%
but if put together...

00:32:21.840 --> 00:32:22.720 line:0%
Could there be

00:32:23.040 --> 00:32:24.480 line:0%
some connections between them?

00:32:24.480 --> 00:32:25.280 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:32:25.560 --> 00:32:26.800 line:0%
I still stand by what I said:

00:32:26.800 --> 00:32:27.600 line:0%
you should be aware of

00:32:27.600 --> 00:32:28.560 line:0%
how many eyes

00:32:28.560 --> 00:32:30.160 line:0%
are watching you and your husband

00:32:30.160 --> 00:32:31.480 line:0%
in the court now.

00:32:31.960 --> 00:32:33.090 line:0%
If you don't help us,

00:32:33.520 --> 00:32:34.520 line:0%
I won't blame you.

00:32:37.800 --> 00:32:38.600 line:0%
Xu.

00:32:39.760 --> 00:32:41.040 line:0%
On our way back from Yingzhou,

00:32:41.040 --> 00:32:43.120 line:0%
we encountered numerous assassination attempts.

00:32:43.120 --> 00:32:43.800 line:0%
It was thanks to the help

00:32:43.800 --> 00:32:46.120 line:0%
of constables from various provinces and prefectures that we survived.

00:32:46.120 --> 00:32:47.400 line:0%
Without this token,

00:32:47.400 --> 00:32:48.320 line:0%
I probably

00:32:48.320 --> 00:32:49.440 line:0%
wouldn't have been able to see you today.

00:32:49.440 --> 00:32:51.240 line:0%
Now that we're back in Xiang'an,

00:32:51.520 --> 00:32:53.980 line:0%
it should be returned to its rightful owner.

00:32:58.320 --> 00:32:59.120 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:33:00.480 --> 00:33:02.640 line:0%
now that Sun Tan has been arrested by the Imperial Investigation Department,

00:33:02.640 --> 00:33:04.300 line:0%
he may not come out unscathed.

00:33:04.600 --> 00:33:05.840 line:0%
But if he is wronged

00:33:06.200 --> 00:33:07.680 line:0%
or has something to say,

00:33:07.760 --> 00:33:08.600 line:0%
as his older brother,

00:33:08.600 --> 00:33:10.130 line:0%
I will definitely help him.

00:33:11.440 --> 00:33:12.760 line:0%
Can you think of a way

00:33:13.040 --> 00:33:14.200 line:0%
to let me see Sun Tan?

00:33:17.600 --> 00:33:19.360 line:0%
I'll draft a report right away

00:33:19.560 --> 00:33:21.820 line:0%
to apply to take charge of Sun Tan's case.

00:33:22.080 --> 00:33:22.680 line:0%
Although Sun Tan

00:33:22.680 --> 00:33:24.680 line:0%
is currently in the Imperial Investigation Department,

00:33:24.680 --> 00:33:26.240 line:0%
the chief judge from the Ministry of Justice

00:33:26.240 --> 00:33:28.570 line:0%
can still go to the prison to question him.

00:33:32.720 --> 00:33:33.520 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:33:34.720 --> 00:33:36.680 line:0%
I'll go with you.

00:33:54.240 --> 00:33:55.080 line:0%
He... he... he...

00:33:55.080 --> 00:33:56.160 line:0%
He's lost so much blood.

00:33:56.160 --> 00:33:57.320 line:0%
Will he die?

00:33:57.680 --> 00:33:58.840 line:0%
He's now in the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:33:58.840 --> 00:33:59.640 line:0%
Who would care about

00:33:59.640 --> 00:34:00.800 line:0%
his life?

00:34:02.080 --> 00:34:03.040 line:0%
If you're afraid,

00:34:03.040 --> 00:34:04.700 line:0%
you can go back and wait for me.

00:34:09.430 --> 00:34:10.470 line:0%
I am Yan Xing,

00:34:10.470 --> 00:34:12.360 line:0%
a junior sixth-rank director under the jurisdiction of the Ministry of Justice,

00:34:12.360 --> 00:34:13.950 line:0%
in charge of presiding over Sun Tan's case.

00:34:13.950 --> 00:34:16.080 line:0%
I am here to interrogate the suspect, Sun Tan.

00:34:16.080 --> 00:34:18.320 line:0%
Sun Tan is a major criminal in our Imperial Investigation Department.

00:34:18.320 --> 00:34:20.800 line:0%
I'm afraid the Ministry of Justice has no authority to interrogate him.

00:34:20.800 --> 00:34:22.280 line:0%
Then I'll go to the prison to question him.

00:34:22.280 --> 00:34:24.010 line:0%
That should be allowed, right?

00:34:37.920 --> 00:34:39.650 line:0%
Only two people are allowed in.

00:34:43.030 --> 00:34:45.760 line:0%
Go back to the Ministry of Justice and wait for me.

00:34:46.080 --> 00:34:48.689 line:0%
Well... I'll be waiting for you outside.

00:34:51.090 --> 00:34:54.420 line:0%
[Imperial Investigation Department]

00:35:24.840 --> 00:35:25.700 line:0%
Commander Sun.

00:35:28.560 --> 00:35:29.420 line:0%
Commander Sun.

00:35:30.920 --> 00:35:31.780 line:0%
Commander Sun.

00:35:32.960 --> 00:35:33.760 line:0%
It's me,

00:35:33.960 --> 00:35:34.920 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:35:47.200 --> 00:35:49.460 line:0%
Have you also sided with the villain Lai?

00:35:49.840 --> 00:35:50.680 line:0%
I'm the chief judge

00:35:50.680 --> 00:35:51.800 line:0%
from the Ministry of Justice for this case.

00:35:51.800 --> 00:35:53.800 line:0%
I'm here to help you clear your name.

00:35:53.960 --> 00:35:55.320 line:0%
The Imperial Investigation Department

00:35:55.320 --> 00:35:56.960 line:0%
accuses you of embezzlement and corruption,

00:35:56.960 --> 00:35:58.360 line:0%
and colluding with bandits.

00:35:58.360 --> 00:35:59.400 line:0%
If you are wronged,

00:35:59.400 --> 00:36:00.360 line:0%
tell me,

00:36:00.360 --> 00:36:01.440 line:0%
and I'll present your testimony.

00:36:01.440 --> 00:36:02.240 line:0%
It's useless.

00:36:05.720 --> 00:36:06.720 line:0%
It won't help.

00:36:13.920 --> 00:36:15.160 line:0%
If you are wronged,

00:36:15.280 --> 00:36:17.920 line:0%
Commander Xu and the brothers of the constables

00:36:17.920 --> 00:36:19.800 line:0%
will risk their lives to get you out.

00:36:19.800 --> 00:36:21.000 line:0%
I will also do everything I can

00:36:21.000 --> 00:36:22.160 line:0%
to clear your name.

00:36:23.480 --> 00:36:25.880 line:0%
The more you help, the more people will die.

00:36:29.640 --> 00:36:30.840 line:0%
You should leave now.

00:36:36.720 --> 00:36:37.520 line:0%
Sun Tan.

00:36:40.240 --> 00:36:41.560 line:0%
I'm not dead yet.

00:36:49.400 --> 00:36:50.200 line:0%
Commander Xu?

00:36:52.210 --> 00:36:53.380 line:0%
[Constable Marshal]

00:36:52.920 --> 00:36:53.720 line:0%
This token

00:36:54.120 --> 00:36:55.640 line:0%
is waiting for you to claim it.

00:36:55.640 --> 00:36:56.920 line:0%
You must hang in there.

00:37:00.820 --> 00:37:02.460 line:0%
[Constable Marshal]

00:37:23.480 --> 00:37:24.400 line:0%
Director Yan,

00:37:25.280 --> 00:37:26.610 line:0%
I have something to say.

00:37:27.320 --> 00:37:28.120 line:0%
Okay.

00:37:28.320 --> 00:37:29.520 line:0%
Okay, I'll record it.

00:37:40.880 --> 00:37:41.720 line:0%
Most of the constables

00:37:41.720 --> 00:37:43.720 line:0%
came from the martial world,

00:37:45.960 --> 00:37:46.880 line:0%
and we were all

00:37:46.880 --> 00:37:49.030 line:0%
won over by Commander Xu's charisma

00:37:49.240 --> 00:37:52.080 line:0%
and joined the constables because of brotherhood and loyalty.

00:37:52.080 --> 00:37:53.430 line:0%
In Gannan Area,

00:37:53.600 --> 00:37:56.000 line:0%
I naturally wanted to emulate Commander Xu,

00:37:56.000 --> 00:37:58.520 line:0%
forming connections with talented people from the martial world.

00:37:58.520 --> 00:38:00.720 line:0%
This is what they call colluding with bandits.

00:38:00.720 --> 00:38:01.520 line:0%
Well,

00:38:01.540 --> 00:38:03.870 line:0%
what about embezzlement and corruption?

00:38:04.040 --> 00:38:05.600 line:0%
I can't deny that.

00:38:07.320 --> 00:38:09.330 line:0%
I did take the money.

00:38:09.840 --> 00:38:12.480 line:0%
There are many merchants traveling through Gannan Area.

00:38:12.480 --> 00:38:13.520 line:0%
The constables

00:38:13.520 --> 00:38:15.280 line:0%
protect them from bandits,

00:38:15.400 --> 00:38:18.530 line:0%
and in return, they give us money as a token of gratitude.

00:38:19.480 --> 00:38:20.680 line:0%
Naturally, I used it to treat my brothers

00:38:20.680 --> 00:38:22.010 line:0%
from the martial world.

00:38:22.680 --> 00:38:24.470 line:0%
You can explain your situation

00:38:24.680 --> 00:38:25.760 line:0%
and have merchants testify for you

00:38:25.760 --> 00:38:27.160 line:0%
to reduce your sentence.

00:38:30.800 --> 00:38:31.810 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:38:32.040 --> 00:38:33.560 line:0%
why don't you understand yet?

00:38:33.560 --> 00:38:34.480 line:0%
What Lai Luozhi wants

00:38:34.480 --> 00:38:35.920 line:0%
is to leave the constables in Gannan Area

00:38:35.920 --> 00:38:37.140 line:0%
without a leader.

00:38:39.960 --> 00:38:40.820 line:0%
Commander Sun,

00:38:41.240 --> 00:38:42.600 line:0%
do you know why?

00:38:43.920 --> 00:38:45.550 line:0%
After Mo Qianzhi's death,

00:38:45.800 --> 00:38:47.520 line:0%
there was a major reshuffle of officials in Yingzhou,

00:38:47.520 --> 00:38:49.640 line:0%
and most of those in power now are Lai Luozhi's people.

00:38:49.640 --> 00:38:51.640 line:0%
Gannan Area is a border fortress

00:38:51.720 --> 00:38:53.450 line:0%
directly connected to Xichen.

00:38:53.480 --> 00:38:54.800 line:0%
Even from Nanlang, which is far south,

00:38:54.800 --> 00:38:57.560 line:0%
one can take a detour through Gannan Area to reach our country.

00:38:57.560 --> 00:38:59.890 line:0%
If the constables are unable to stop them,

00:39:00.040 --> 00:39:01.440 line:0%
that border fortress...

00:39:03.320 --> 00:39:04.860 line:0%
Recently, there have been

00:39:04.960 --> 00:39:05.880 line:0%
many people from Nanlang and Xichen

00:39:05.880 --> 00:39:07.480 line:0%
appearing in Xiang'an City.

00:39:07.800 --> 00:39:08.600 line:0%
It seems that

00:39:08.600 --> 00:39:09.520 line:0%
Lai Luozhi

00:39:09.640 --> 00:39:11.890 line:0%
wants to control Gannan Area entirely.

00:39:12.000 --> 00:39:13.240 line:0%
But what he's aiming for

00:39:13.240 --> 00:39:14.800 line:0%
is far beyond just Gannan Area.

00:39:14.800 --> 00:39:16.720 line:0%
I'm afraid he intends to collude with foreign tribes

00:39:16.720 --> 00:39:18.250 line:0%
and plot rebellion.

00:39:21.600 --> 00:39:22.400 line:0%
Commander Xu.

00:39:26.400 --> 00:39:28.480 line:0%
If the constables want to frame me,

00:39:28.840 --> 00:39:31.440 line:0%
you should at least have some evidence, right?

00:39:35.560 --> 00:39:36.400 line:0%
Mrs. Shen,

00:39:36.960 --> 00:39:39.560 line:0%
you came to my Imperial Investigation Department as guests,

00:39:39.560 --> 00:39:40.440 line:0%
but you keep saying things

00:39:40.440 --> 00:39:42.000 line:0%
to falsely accuse me.

00:39:43.280 --> 00:39:46.040 line:0%
This puts me in a difficult position.

00:39:46.800 --> 00:39:49.880 line:0%
I am the chief judge from the Ministry of Justice for this case.

00:39:49.880 --> 00:39:52.800 line:0%
I'm here to interrogate the main suspect, Sun Tan, according to the rules,

00:39:52.800 --> 00:39:55.040 line:0%
and to truthfully record the suspect's testimony.

00:39:55.040 --> 00:39:57.200 line:0%
The constables are accompanying me as co-investigators.

00:39:57.200 --> 00:39:58.880 line:0%
There is nothing improper with the process.

00:39:58.880 --> 00:39:59.680 line:0%
Is that so?

00:40:00.400 --> 00:40:01.280 line:0%
Mrs. Shen,

00:40:01.280 --> 00:40:03.840 line:0%
you have become more sharp-tongued.

00:40:04.160 --> 00:40:05.480 line:0%
Today is the first interrogation.

00:40:05.480 --> 00:40:06.200 line:0%
After I return

00:40:06.200 --> 00:40:08.080 line:0%
to organize the case files and submit the report,

00:40:08.080 --> 00:40:10.240 line:0%
I will come here to conduct a second interrogation.

00:40:10.240 --> 00:40:11.200 line:0%
During this time,

00:40:11.200 --> 00:40:13.160 line:0%
Lord Lai, please ensure

00:40:13.240 --> 00:40:14.700 line:0%
the safety of the suspect.

00:40:21.040 --> 00:40:21.720 line:0%
It will depend

00:40:21.720 --> 00:40:23.360 line:0%
on his own fate.

00:40:23.600 --> 00:40:25.360 line:0%
The cells in the Imperial Investigation Department

00:40:25.360 --> 00:40:26.160 line:0%
can never guarantee

00:40:26.160 --> 00:40:28.220 line:0%
that prisoners here will stay alive.

00:40:29.320 --> 00:40:30.430 line:0%
How dare you?

00:40:33.480 --> 00:40:34.280 line:0%
Commander Xu,

00:40:34.840 --> 00:40:35.760 line:0%
Director Yan,

00:40:36.920 --> 00:40:38.080 line:0%
go back now.

00:41:06.120 --> 00:41:07.520 line:0%
I'm not planning on keeping

00:41:07.520 --> 00:41:09.120 line:0%
you and Mrs. Shen here today.

00:41:09.600 --> 00:41:11.330 line:0%
You don't need to be so nervous.

00:41:14.360 --> 00:41:15.280 line:0%
However, I still want

00:41:15.280 --> 00:41:16.880 line:0%
to give you a piece of advice:

00:41:17.520 --> 00:41:19.960 line:0%
the criminals arrested by the Imperial Investigation Department

00:41:19.960 --> 00:41:20.720 line:0%
cannot be

00:41:20.720 --> 00:41:22.720 line:0%
easily exonerated.

00:41:23.280 --> 00:41:24.940 line:0%
You'd better think carefully

00:41:25.440 --> 00:41:27.240 line:0%
about what you should listen to,

00:41:27.640 --> 00:41:29.040 line:0%
what you should report,

00:41:29.880 --> 00:41:30.840 line:0%
and what

00:41:31.800 --> 00:41:33.640 line:0%
you should keep to yourselves.